sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
A create route should protect the collection before changing it.

```js
app.post("/api/events", (req, res) => {
  const { title, category } = req.body;

  if (!title || !category) {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: "title and category are required" });
  }

  const event = {
    id: events.length + 1,
    title,
    category,
  };

  events.push(event);
  return res.status(201).json(event);
});
```

**Step by step:** read the expected fields, reject missing input before mutation, construct one new resource, store it exactly once, then return the created representation. Invalid input must leave the collection unchanged.

